# Bugsy's Vice Coast Portfolio 🌴

An open-world-game-style developer portfolio, built with **Claude Code** for the Byte Buddy video *"I Built a GTA 6-Style Portfolio with Claude Code"*.

Plain **HTML, CSS and JavaScript**. No framework, no build step. Open `index.html` and it runs.

**▶ Live demo:** https://bytebuddy-dev.github.io/gta6-style-portfolio/
**🎬 Watch the build:** [I Built a GTA 6-Style Portfolio with Claude Code](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hEl5TOqYgd0) · more on [Byte Buddy](https://www.youtube.com/@bytebuddydev)

