## Try the cheats

Click anywhere on the page (not in the form), then type:

| Cheat | What happens |
|---|---|
| `HESOYAM` | Every skill jumps to five stars |
| `↑ ↑ ↓ ↓ ← → ← → B A` | Party mode: the whole site changes colour (type it again to stop) |
| a secret six-letter word | Bugsy launches straight off the screen. Hint: what he does on Fridays |

On a phone, tap the cheat cards instead.

## Run it locally

```bash
git clone https://github.com/bytebuddy-dev/gta6-style-portfolio.git
cd gta6-style-portfolio
# open index.html in your browser, or serve it:
npx serve .
```

## What's inside

| Feature | Where | The trick |
|---|---|---|
| Synthwave sunset with parallax palms | `index.html` hero, `style.css` | One CSS variable (`--scroll`) set on scroll; each layer moves at its own speed |
| Wanted-level skills ★★★★☆ | `.skills` | Stars light up one by one with an `IntersectionObserver` |
| Mission cards | `.missions` | Comic-style halftone dots from a single `radial-gradient` |
| Minimap navigation | `.minimap` | Fixed-position nav; the active section's blip turns pink and the arrow points at it |
| Cheat codes | `main.js` | Keep the last 10 keys, compare the end. Try **HESOYAM**, **↑↑↓↓←→←→BA** and a secret six-letter one |
| "Mission passed" contact form | `#contact` | Demo only: nothing is sent anywhere |

Phones can tap the cheat cards instead of typing. Motion is turned off for people who set *reduce motion*.

## Make it yours

1. Swap `assets/bugsy.png` for your photo or avatar.
2. Edit the skills (`data-level="1"` to `"5"`) and the mission cards in `index.html`.
3. To make the contact form really send email, point it at a form service (for example Formspree) and remove `e.preventDefault()` in `main.js`.
4. Deploy free with **GitHub Pages**: repo **Settings → Pages → Deploy from branch → `main` / root**.

## What went wrong while building it

Claude Code got most of it right the first time, but not everything. See [BUILD-LOG.md](BUILD-LOG.md) for every bug and how screenshots caught it.

